{
  "archetype": "workspace-meta",
  "displayName": "工作区顶层元治理、单源规则与物理卫生",
  "rootDirectory": ".",
  "allowedExtensions": [
    ".json",
    ".md",
    ".js"
  ],
  "pathJail": {
    "allowedPrefixes": [
      ".agents/subagents/",
      "scripts/common/",
      "AGENTS.md"
    ],
    "forbiddenPrefixes": [
      "workspace-timing/",
      "auto-refactor/",
      "WebGames/",
      "scripts/ps1/",
      "scripts/sh/",
      "fractal-git/"
    ]
  },
  "associatedSkills": [
    "batch-commit",
    "constraint-driven-development",
    "docs-archive-governance",
    "release-package-workflow",
    "subagent-orchestration",
    "rule-catalog-governance",
    "coding-craft",
    "complexity-budget",
    "test-benchmark-engineering",
    "debugging-and-error-recovery",
    "gate-governance"
  ],
  "rigidAxioms": [
    "零空文件：全仓严禁创建或遗留 0 字节文件或纯空白字符文件",
    "单源规则目录 (rule-catalog.json) 收录 508 条规则 (autoRefactor: 374, workspaceTiming: 49, webGames: 50, globalTooling: 18, fractalGit: 17)，规则 ID 零虚构 (RCFG-RULE-DRIFT)",
    "提交规范：必须声明 [Project: ...]，有效字数 >= 30，零黑话与纯客观技术事实",
    "单文件双轨体积 (ELOC <= 900 / LOC <= 1400) 与 AST 切片预算 (CC <= 15, Depth <= 4)"
  ],
  "localVerification": [
    "node scripts/common/validate-physical-hygiene.js",
    "node scripts/common/generate-rule-catalog.js",
    "node scripts/common/evaluate-eloc-budget.js"
  ]
}
